Sheesh, my masters are crazy!

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:24.000
It's all yours, Ryuga!

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:28.430
This will repay my debt to you!

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:30.770
Ray Blade!

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:49.700
That's...

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:59.110
<b>Episode 11</b>

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:59.110
<b>A Wish, The Color of Cherry Blossoms</b>

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:05.080
Why does it always turn out this way?!

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.620
It's incomprehensible! And most annoying!

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:15.990
So, so you survived, did you? Make preparations for our escape.

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:19.350
Unfortunately, there's only room for one person.

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:22.790
In that case, you'll remain here.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:28.560
What's the meaning of this?

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:32.510
I still have a mission to carry out, you see.

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:34.550
What are you saying?

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:40.000
I must deliver the data acquired here today to Dr. Cyanan.

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:47.980
Actually, the Doctor said that he'd like to go over the results of your research to date.

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:50.530
Damn you, 227, you're...!

00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:55.020
I really wanted you to call me Feldrance.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:10.410
The thing is, Professor, it was you who made me this way.

00:04:32.990 --> 00:04:35.730
I pulled the trigger.

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:44.720
A Saint warrior was using Commander Misato as a shield, and I...

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:46.230
I killed him.

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:48.560
Mahoro...

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:55.110
I've been hiding that the whole time I've been with you.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:56.500
It's all right.

00:04:57.220 --> 00:04:58.350
And that's not all.

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:05.630
That bellflower person I saw... That was you, wasn't it?

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.730
I knew.

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:12.300
I could see that it was all connected.

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:17.850
Why you came to my house and the feelings that brought you there.

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:22.150
And why you always looked so sad.

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:26.420
So don't... Don't cry.

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:41.980
So, you're Suguru Misato.

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:49.500
I'm truly sorry that our lack of ability put you through all this.

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:54.070
Don't mention it. But how are Mahoro and Minawa doing?

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:59.600
I'm sorry, perhaps I should introduce myself first.

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:04.080
I'm Hayato Daimon, Vesper Commander.

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:07.370
And I'm Deputy Commander Yoshihiko Gunji.

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:12.850
We owe a great deal to your father, the previous commander.

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:19.640
So, everything that Mahoro said was true, then.

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:25.570
I'm sorry. We've put you through a terrible ordeal.

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:30.080
Mahoro, is she... Is she all right?

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:37.500
<b>N
o

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:33.720
It was necessary to hospitalize her to run a few tests,

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:37.280
...but she says she wants to resume her duties as soon as possible.

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:39.480
Her duties?

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:43.620
In other words, she wants to go back to your house.

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:47.290
Go back? You mean she's coming back home?!

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:51.510
Misato, take good care of Mahoro for us.

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:06.040
About that Management girl... Minawa, I mean.

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:09.000
Was she badly hurt?

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:12.680
Her wounds weren't serious at all.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:15.690
However...

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:24.210
Big sister's chicks...

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.940
Oh, did I wake you?

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:51.460
Big sister, I'm sorry... I'm so sorry...

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:55.790
What I did to you and Suguru was horrible.

00:07:56.380 --> 00:08:01.870
That's all right. Suguru, Slash, and I are all fine.

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:04.070
Just as I always thought,

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:09.310
...you're a girl with a wonderful heart who is always thinking of her friends.

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:14.080
I made a promise to 369 a long time ago.

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:20.700
When 369 died, there wasn't a grave or anything to remember her by,

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:23.930
...but I have the promise that I made.

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:28.340
And so I... I...

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:40.110
You're "Minawa Ando", and you always will be.

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:45.080
This is horrible...

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.020
This is plain insanity...

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:49.760
You mean Minawa?

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:53.590
Yes. This is inhuman.

00:08:54.240 --> 00:09:00.020
It can't be right to subject a human... No, any living thing to this.

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:03.850
Even without this wound, her whole body should be screaming in pain...

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:06.210
...from all these repeated, insane operations.

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.740
I'm amazed that she's managed to endure it.

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:12.900
It's a miracle that she's still alive.

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:19.720
I realize this is none of my business, but is there anything my people can do to help?

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:22.380
You're Ryuga, right?

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:27.640
There may be some means of saving her at Saint's homeland.

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:29.170
Are you sure?

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:35.480
I don't believe we have any right to ask you people to do this.

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:40.920
Now that we're all Terrans, it's embarrassing to have to ask.

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:45.680
I myself am deeply involved in this incident.

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:51.110
Besides, trying to save her may prove to be the catalyst...

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:53.590
...that will point Terrans and Saint down a better path.

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:57.230
Or is that too much to hope for?

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:03.240
Anyway, how is Mahoro?

00:10:04.280 --> 00:10:08.440
That's... We're not going to tell you that!

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:11.980
As for Mahoro... Nobody can...

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:13.830
I see.

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:20.520
Once you reach a decision regarding Minawa, let me know.

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:30.600
You don't suppose that Suguru hasn't been told about Mahoro's life span, do you?

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:37.620
If Mahoro hasn't told him herself, it's none of our business.

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:40.860
Besides, that boy has good intuition.

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:43.180
Maybe he already...

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:10.980
Welcome back.

00:11:14.780 --> 00:11:15.600
We're home.

00:11:14.780 --> 00:11:15.600
We're home.

00:11:28.390 --> 00:11:31.760
Thank you for all you've done for me in the short time I've been here.

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:35.960
I wanted to keep the lies to a minimum,

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:39.080
...so I told the gang that you were really sick...

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:41.600
...and were transferring to another school to get treatment.

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:43.840
I see.

00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:46.670
Here, Minawa.

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:48.810
<b></b><i>Travel Guide</i>

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:52.020
<b></b><i>Travel Guide</i>

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:51.680
Why don't we go to a hot spring for a nice, long soak?

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:59.380
Naturally, we'd be going with Miyuki, Rin, Chizu, Kawahara, and Hamaji.

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:02.100
Together... with everyone?

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:04.030
Yes, all together.

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:05.890
Even Ms. Shikijo?

00:12:07.650 --> 00:12:08.160
Uh...

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:12.050
Of course. Ms. Shikijo, too.

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:21.790
Hey!

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:24.910
C'mon, c'mon, what's the holdup?

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:39.120
Are you okay, Mahoro?

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.660
Yes... I'm sorry.

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:46.570
Are you a little tired? You should go back to the inn.

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:49.980
No, I tripped on the stairs, that's all.

00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:56.420
Mahoro and I are gonna head back to the inn.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.980
You guys go on and have fun without us.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:00.830
Suguru...

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:02.820
Let's go.

00:13:03.490 --> 00:13:07.480
Suguru seems stronger than he used to, somehow.

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:11.150
Yeah, he's so much manlier.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:18.840
What, you still kept yours out of loyalty too, Rin?

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:25.240
He gave all three of us the same keychain in return on White Day, huh?

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:29.170
What do you suppose he gave to Mahoro?

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:32.850
It's bad manners to ask that...

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:34.230
Chizu?

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.280
Wha...? Wait, don't tell me you...

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:41.920
No, I'm not gonna let a little thing like this get me down!

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:43.430
You're coming, too.

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:44.880
Why me?

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:47.680
<b></b>Baths

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:57.980
<b>Open Air Baths</b>

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:54.660
M-Mahoro, what are you doing here?

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:58.880
Um, Miyuki and the girls asked me down just now.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:01.940
<b>Open Air Baths</b>

00:13:59.210 --> 00:14:01.010
And Kawahara asked me to meet him here.

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:03.410
What a coincidence.

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:05.160
It sure is.

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:12.210
W-Well, you take your bath first, Suguru. I'll come back later.

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:14.500
Wait, don't go!

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:17.940
Uh, d-do you think you could wash my back?

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:21.540
Like that time when you first came to my house?

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:29.050
Of course.

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:34.040
Looks like it worked.

00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:37.850
Great! Now I can freely wallow in misery!

00:14:38.320 --> 00:14:41.640
Anyway, we've got to force them together.

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:47.630
So, here ends four loves, huh?

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:53.110
Please don't put our feelings in the same category as yours, Ms. Shikijo.

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:56.490
Yours are as close to "lust" as you can get.

00:14:56.610 --> 00:15:00.060
Grownups are lucky. At times like this, they can turn to alcohol.

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:04.220
Don't give me that! You don't know how hard it is to be an adult.

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:09.500
Still, I have to say that you three sure have become a little more like women.

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:10.240
Huh?

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:35.660
Mahoro?

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:43.940
Is something wrong? Are you feeling sick again?

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:44.800
W-Wait!

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:52.720
I... I'm sorry, Suguru.

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:57.950
I don't understand it. It wasn't like this before.

00:15:59.010 --> 00:16:01.050
I feel really, really embarrassed...

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:08.160
W-Well, if I see you feeling that embarrassed, it's gonna make ME embarrassed, too.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:11.560
I-If you don't want to, that's okay.

00:16:18.380 --> 00:16:21.390
I've done all I can. But...

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:27.060
The time you have left is practically zero.

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:31.090
If that's the case, then now more than ever...

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:35.610
I... I want to truly live in the time that I have left.

00:16:54.740 --> 00:17:02.680
I came back to you so that I could spend the time left to me being useful to someone.

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:11.970
But I think that I was the one that I really wanted to be happy.

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:16.330
I don't think there's anything wrong with that.

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:19.910
Mahoro, look at that.

00:17:21.490 --> 00:17:22.390
At what?

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:25.960
Look, right in the middle of that hill over there.

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:29.480
It's beautiful...

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:31.790
Let's go take a look later.

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:33.130
Of course.

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:39.140
I wonder what those two are up to?

00:17:39.900 --> 00:17:42.460
There's no way to tell from here.

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:47.830
What are we gonna do...? You don't think we went too far, do you?

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:53.020
What if they're doing you-know-what right about now?!

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:57.240
If you've totally given up on him, that's for the best!

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:01.270
